# Storage root for the local "S3-mimic" asset bucket.
#
# Layout written at runtime by server/src/services/storage.service.js:
#
#   storage/assets/<assetId>/original.stp     <- raw CAD, provenance only, never rendered
#   storage/assets/<assetId>/converted.glb    <- web-ready mesh, served to React Three Fiber
#
# Everything in this directory except this .gitkeep is gitignored.
# Storage keys stored in MongoDB are relative POSIX paths ("assets/<id>/converted.glb"),
# so swapping this filesystem root for a real S3 bucket only touches storage.service.js.
